text.section:
The Department shall, in consultation with the Department of Veterans Services, create and make available to all employers in the Commonwealth a poster describing benefits and services available to veterans. The poster shall, at a minimum, include information about the following benefits and services:

Department of Veterans Services' programs, contact information, and website address;


Substance abuse and mental health treatment services;


Educational, workforce, and training resources;


Tax benefits;


Eligibility for unemployment insurance benefits under state or federal law;


Legal services; and


The U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs Veterans Crisis Line.
